        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8275167f-5f0f-4eba-a11a-99fbcca79e32).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning Agent.\rOur client is the son of former owner of the vineyard now owned by Don Yates. His father was betrayed by some former security-employees and evil mastermind Kenneth Flowers, making Yates&apos; take-over possible. Back then the chain-of-events leading to the lost of his family property looked like accidents. You should pay them back in the same manner. However Yates should be untouched for now, instead steal the 1945 Gran Paladino he is allways boasting about to send him a message.",
